WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.083
Rwelani tshiṱanda hune na ṱoḓa mutalo waṋu u tshi thoma hone ni imise mulenzhe muthihi tsini natsho.

00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:17.833
Tshimbidzani muṅwe mulenzhe u gonya kana u tsa fhethu ho sendamaho u swikela lutambo lu tshi fhaṱekea kha tshiswayo tsha vhuimo vhuthihi.

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:20.667
Rwelani tshiṱanda henefho.

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:31.208
Dzulani ni sa tshimbidzi uyo mulenzhe, monisani mulenzhe wa u thoma u ye thungo iṅwe, wanani vhuimo vhuthihi hafhu ni rwele tshiṱanda.

00:00:31.208 --> 00:00:43.458
Bvelani phanḓa ni tshi pfuka fhethu ho sendamaho.

00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:52.125
Mutalo wa muhumbulo u pfukaho fhethu ho sendamaho u ṱumanyaho zwiṱhavhi zwi re kha vhuimo vhuthihi.
